  <h1>Network Settings Extension</h1>
  <p>This extension allows you to access your computer's network settings from anywhere.</p>
  <button id="connectButton">Connect to Network</button>
</body>
</html>
```

This HTML file displays a simple message and a button that the user can click to connect to their network.

